{"Title":"An Act to ensure fairness in retirement benefits for institutional teachers","BillNumber":"H2442","DocketNumber":"HD2636","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"D_B1","Name":"David Biele","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/D_B1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T15:11:45.873"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"D_B1","Name":"David Biele","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/D_B1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T15:11:45.8733333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2442/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Biele of Boston, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2442) of David Biele relative to the retirement benefits for certain institutional teachers.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 3 of chapter 32 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2012 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the words \"assistant deputy superintendent\",  in line 304, the following words:- “Teacher C, D, E, Education Specialist A/B, C, D, and Librarian A/B, C or equivalent or successive titles who have been employed in such capacities or other Group 4 titles for 10 years or more;”.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}